C ELM16B              SPECIAL PARAMETERS (TYPE 16)
C
C FOTILT     TILT OF FOCAL PLANE ON 16. 15. ELEMENT.
C SM         MASS OF PARTICLES ON 16. 3. ELEMENT.
C TH         FLOOR COORDINATE ROTATION ANGLE
C PH         FLOOR COORDINATE ELEVATION ANGLE.
C PREF       REFERENCE MOMENTUM FOR MAGNET SETTINGS
C LPRF       INDICATES IF REFERENCE MOMENTUM IS SPECIFIED SEPARATELY FROM 
C                      BEAM ELEMENT
C PSPED        LOGICAL   INDICATED WHETHER PARTICLE TO BE HISTOGRAMMED
C                        FOR NON-DECAY CASE HAS BEEN SPECIFIED AS
C                        OTHER THAN THE PARENT 
C PSPEC(3)     LOGICAL   INDICATES WHETHER PARENT, SON, OR DAUGHTER
C                        IS TO BE HISTOGRAMMED FOR NON-DECAY CASE.
C TILT       INDICATES IF ELEMENT IS ROTATED ABOUT LONGITUDINAL AXIS
C
      LOGICAL         LPRF, PSPED, PSPEC(3), TILT
      REAL            FOTILT, SM, TH, PH, PREF
C
      COMMON /ELM16B/ FOTILT, SM, TH, PH, PREF, LPRF, PSPED, PSPEC, 
     1                TILT
